<attribute name="mainDescription" nodeId="28615b01">&lt;p&gt;
    Facilitate discussions with client stakeholders to understand the scope and desired features of non-production
    environments. Hardware and software resources required are typically the main discussion topics. Capture all the
    different interfaces, applications, hardware, and network requirements needed in each environment.
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        &lt;p&gt;
            Conduct interviews to gather sizing metrics (e.g., number of dimensions for a multi-dimensional application)
            which can be specific to the type of application being developed; common types of metrics include:
        &lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
    &lt;ol&gt;
        &lt;li&gt;
            Total number of users
        &lt;/li&gt;
        &lt;li&gt;
            Number of concurrent users
        &lt;/li&gt;
        &lt;li&gt;
            Number of business processes supported
        &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Review metrics with hardware vendor
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Run sizing estimation with hardware vendor
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Determine software features
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Validate results
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</attribute>
